{
  "_comment": "Runtime seccomp profile for JA4proxy (Phase 56b).",
  "_description": "Strict profile applied after startup is complete. Derived from proxy.json with execve/fork/vfork removed to prevent process spawning (container escape vector). clone(2) is retained for asyncio/threading (CLONE_THREAD flag path) but the broad fork/exec family is denied. open/openat are retained because Python's import system performs lazy imports at runtime; their use is monitored by the integrity monitor (Phase 35). Apply via src/security/seccomp_transition.apply_runtime_seccomp().",
  "_phase": "runtime: strict lockdown — no fork/exec, no new processes",
  "defaultAction": "SCMP_ACT_ERRNO",
  "defaultErrnoRet": 1,
